            "reviewBody": "Make it often, very easy. However I like mine a bit chunky, so I skip the roux, and don't blend it. This is often my starting soup I had added, other veggies, potatoes, green bean, carrots, edamame etc. The broccoli and cauliflower make it creamy, and I love the spicy pepper kick, It's a keeper !",
